        "title_is_group": false,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Greetings! GTG is once again attending PAX East this year in Boston, MA, which runs from 11 April - 13 April, and we are looking for booth volunteers!</p><p><strong><span>What You Would Do:</span></strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: normal;\">Run demo games.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: normal;\">Talk to people about our game.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: normal;\">Spend 50% of the Expo Hall hours (which run 8-6 all three days) in the booth helping out.</span></li></ul><p><strong>What You Would Get:</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">A Free Exhibitor Badge to this sold out show!</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Two Free Tshirts</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Free Dinner &amp; Drinks Thurs. or Fri. evening with GTG and all of the volunteers.</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you are interested, or have any questions, please email me at paul@greaterthangames.com!</p>",
